  },
  "description": "The component\u2011detection manifest, version\u202f1, records three distinct dependencies. The first entry is a Rust crate managed by Cargo: the library **serde**, version\u202f1.0.130, is included as a regular (non\u2011development) dependency.  \n\nThe second entry originates from a Git repository; the source is\u202fhttps://github.com/example/repo.git at commit\u202fa1b2c3d4e5f6. This component is listed without any development\u2011dependency flag, implying it is a direct production component.  \n\nThe final entry is an npm package: **lodash** at version\u202f4.17.21. It is marked as a development dependency and traces its root to a Go module, **github.com/example/lib**, version\u202fv2.3.4, which serves as the originating dependency for this npm component.",
  "reference_json": {
    "version": 1,
    "registrations": [
      {
        "component": {
          "type": "cargo",
          "cargo": {
            "name": "serde",
            "version": "1.0.130"
          }
        },
        "developmentDependency": false
      },
      {
        "component": {
          "type": "git",
          "git": {
            "commitHash": "a1b2c3d4e5f6",
            "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/repo.git"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "component": {
          "type": "npm",
          "npm": {
            "name": "lodash",
            "version": "4.17.21"
          }
        },
        "dependencyRoots": [
          {
            "type": "go",
            "go": {
              "name": "github.com/example/lib",
              "version": "v2.3.4"
            }
          }
        ],
        "developmentDependency": true
      }
    ]
  }
